From: WeetHet <stas.ale66@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] index: ignore non-UTF-8 Git paths in changed-path index

Rebased onto Jujutsu v0.46.0: the git backend lookup uses try_find_object and
the existing not-found helper, and the diff callback returns gix::ExnResult.

